 Final Numbers 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data: Financial Modeling Prep ; Chart: Dan Primack/Axios Stripe's next big acquisition act is expected to be PayPal, as it continues to work with PE firm Advent International on a takeover that would be worth more than $50 billion.

 Wall Street is betting that Stripe and Advent will sweeten their initial $60.50 per share bid , given that shares are now trading above that price. 
 
